<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Super Side Dash Tech</Major>
    <Description>Super Side Dash for The Strongest Battlegrounds

This side dash makes you go almost twice as far using the Emote Dash Tech.

Before activating the macro, make sure you bring up your Emote Wheel and aim at any emote. 
the macro will automaticallly click on the emote and press the keybinds in order for the Super Dash to work.

THIS ONLY TAKES YOU TO THE RIGHT SIDE, if you want it to dash to the left you can edit the macro and change
the D keybind to your A.

Enjoy your day ! &lt;3</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 26 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 24 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 18 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 6 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 71 ms
